DESCRIPTION:Comedian\, Actor\, Producer Tony Rock is the hardest working ma
 n in show business. Born in the same Brooklyn Hospital where most of his ei
 ght brothers and sisters arrived into the world\, Tony was born laughing an
 d it was quickly apparent that his big brother wasn't going to be the only 
 famous comedian in the family.\n\nTony has proven to be one of television's
  best hosts having played the role of ringleader on HBO’s weekly stand-up
  comedy series  All Def Comedy \, NBA TV's  The Warm Up\,  along with BE
 T’s  Black Card Revoked  and  Apollo Live \, all while co-starring in 
 his first primetime network series - CBS'  Living Biblically.\n\nPerformin
 g stand-up comedy continues to be Tony's first love and this year has prove
 n no different. You can see him on tour in 2018 as one of the featured acts
  on the  Platinum Comedy Tour  with Mike Epps\, The  Festival Of Laughs 
  with Comedienne Sommore\, and his own Tony Rock Live club tour!\n\nOutsid
 e of the lights-camera-action\, Tony works tirelessly as the founder of the
  MyROCK Diabetes Foundation\, a charity organization established in honor o
 f his late father.\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $9
 0 food & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\
 n\n**The Private Skybox Suite includes up to 10 tickets\, a $400 Food & Bev
 erage voucher\, a personal server\, a private restroom\, and all gratuity c
 harges.\n\nAny additional food and drink costs above $400 will be billed at
